      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Work-around for this is to use the REST API.</p>\n\n<p>For E datastreams, HEAD does show the content size (without actually retrieving the stream, tested by referencing a 1GB file and doing a HEAD).</p>\n\n<p>For R datastreams it would be necessary to follow the redirect, and do a HEAD on the destination URL.</p>",
