  "description": "<p>\n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-64\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-64\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Datastream SIZE attribute not fully implemented\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-64\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n introduces persisting size of M datastreams in FOXML and reporting these via API calls.</p>\n\n<p>Implement SIZE attribute for E and R datastreams:  eg when the SIZE attribute is requested, do a HEAD request on the external content (following redirects as necessary) and report the HTTP response Content-Length header.</p>\n\n<p>Ensure these attributes are provided by HEAD requests for datastream dissemination via the REST API.</p>",
